	(text "T48-22 tile  -  2-layer standard\nProject > Project Settings > Text Variables: set TILE_FAMILY, TILE_VARIANT, TILE_REV.\nPads P1..P22 are the tile base pads (bottom side). Delete a no-connect flag to use a pad.\nStandard pinout (inferred by analogy with T44-14 / T48-16 (no T48-22 tile yet)): P1=GND, P20=+V, P22=NRST.\nFab: Standard calculator: 2 layers / 0.4 mm / 4/4 mil / min hole 0.2 mm / ENIG / tenting"
